note right of BooksFileSystemDiscoveryJob
  Discovers the files of every library content location, writes
  them in bounded batches to the staging results table and, when
  the library opts in, compares directory scan fingerprints to
  skip unchanged directories (see ADR-0004, ADR-0005, ADR-0007).
end note

note right of MediaLibraryScanDiffJob
  Marks the staging results against the media library scan
  snapshot of the previous scan with a single database-side
  diff (see ADR-0004).
end note

note right of MediaLibraryScanHashJob
  Computes the content hashes of the files that changed since
  the previous scan, in bounded pages (see ADR-0004).
end note

note right of MediaLibraryScanResultsSaveJob
  Persists the results of the current scan and swaps the scan
  snapshot in a single transaction. Always the last job in the
  directed acyclic job graph.
end note

class ScanFailurePublisher {
    + {static} PublishAsync(serviceScopeFactory: IServiceScopeFactory, libraryId: LibraryId, compositeKey: MediaLibraryScanCompositeId, exception: Exception, token: CancellationToken): Task
}

note top of ScanFailurePublisher
  Helper used by every scan job to publish the
  LibraryScanFailedDomainEvent, so that a failed scan
  releases its processing resources (see ADR-0009).
end note

