note top of BookLibraryTypeScanner
  Builds the books scan job graph: file system discovery,
  scan diff, hashing, optional GoodReads metadata enrichment
  and scan results save, splicing the plugin jobs registered
  at the ScanJobHooks hook points (see ADR-0008).
end note

